*
!.devcontainer/
!.devcontainer/bashrc
!nix/
!nix/*.nix
!flake.lock
!flake.nix
!src/
!src/compiler/
!src/compiler/python/
!src/compiler/python/**
!src/devex/
!src/devex/lsp/
!src/devex/lsp/**
!src/language/
!src/language/**
!src/stdlib/
!src/stdlib/**

# Runtime/build output inside otherwise admitted source trees never belongs in
# the container context. The deny-all rule keeps build/ out entirely; the
# flake's own modules live in nix/ and are admitted above.
src/**/__pycache__/
src/**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.btrc-cache/
**/.DS_Store
